  "details": "I have sandals on my avatar that are a few inches or so off of the ground, and I would like to be able to have my toe bone where the actual toes are, and not have the sandals sunken into the floor. This feature could be as simple as having a line somewhere in the descriptor that represents where the avatar should come into contact with the floor, so for example, I could lower that line to where the bottom of my sandals are, and that would be where my avatar hits the ground from.",
